                         Program Version 6.0.0  -   RELEASE  -


 With contributions from (in alphabetic order):
   Daniel Aravena         : Magnetic Suceptibility
   Michael Atanasov       : Ab Initio Ligand Field Theory (pilot matlab implementation)
